<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK SETS 1-WK REV REPO 15.2 PCT LIMIT RATE.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK SETS 1-WK REV REPO 15.2 PCT LIMIT RATE.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Thursday set a one-week reverse repo tender to drain liquidity with a limit rate of 15.2 percent, unchanged from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The CNB added that average and maximum yield in its two-week repo earlier on Thursday was 15.2 percent at which all bids were accepted. The minimum yield was 15.19 percent.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
